            "yt-dlp[default]",
            "curl_cffi"
        ],
        "_pip_globals_comment": "HO-TRANSCRIBE-PROCESSOR 2026-07-24: system pip in the FINAL stage installs the yt-dlp NIGHTLY channel (--pre yt-dlp[default], pulls curl_cffi for impersonation) over the stale apk yt-dlp (2026.03.17). Nightly is required for max provider coverage — the latest STABLE (2026.07.04) has Vimeo extractor rot (OAuth 401); nightly 2026.07.23+ fixes it and keeps YouTube byte-identical (proven). Prebuilt musllinux_1_2_x86_64 wheels, no build toolchain. yt-dlp script -> /usr/bin/yt-dlp, overwriting the apk one. Kept fresh between rebuilds by custom/ytdlp-refresh.sh (host cron, parity-guarded)."
    },
